    brief: "<p>Every row in this chapter's routing table picks a strategy from the same three flags. Write <code>chooseStrategy({ personalized, changesOften, behindAuth })</code>: <code>\"CSR\"</code> when the page is <code>behindAuth</code> (no SEO to protect, heavy interaction); otherwise <code>\"SSR\"</code> when <code>personalized</code> (different per user, must be current); otherwise <code>\"ISR\"</code> when <code>changesOften</code> (changes occasionally, must stay fast); otherwise <code>\"SSG\"</code> (same for everyone, SEO matters).</p>",
