    hints: [
      "behindAuth pages have no SEO to protect and are heavy on interaction — check for it first.",
      "Personalised means different per user and must be current — that points at server rendering, not anything static.",
      "If neither of those applies, changesOften is what decides between ISR and plain SSG.",
    ],
    solution: "function chooseStrategy({ personalized = false, changesOften = false, behindAuth = false } = {}) {\n  if (behindAuth) return \"CSR\";\n  if (personalized) return \"SSR\";\n  if (changesOften) return \"ISR\";\n  return \"SSG\";\n}\n",
