    id: "ex-react-diagnose-symptom",
    chapter: "react-cheat",
    level: "intermediate",
    title: "Diagnose it from the symptom",
    brief: "<p>This chapter's bug table maps a symptom straight to its cause and one-line fix. Write <code>diagnose(symptom)</code>, returning <code>{ cause, fix }</code> for a symptom listed in the table, exactly as the table states it, or <code>null</code> for anything not in it (matching must be exact — no fuzzy or case-insensitive lookup).</p>",
