    brief: "<p>Write <code>chooseRendererMode({ hostIsImmutable, isTestEnvironment })</code>, following this chapter's three modes: <code>\"no-op\"</code> when <code>isTestEnvironment</code> (nothing is committed anywhere, the way the test renderer works); otherwise <code>\"persistence\"</code> when <code>hostIsImmutable</code> (every change produces a new node tree); otherwise <code>\"mutation\"</code> (nodes modified in place, the way the DOM works).</p>",
